并检查极大性，同时考察参数区间端点、支持约束及平坦最大值区间。\n\n## 条件与边界\n\n求导等于0只是候选；有些模型无内点根，有些最大似然估计不唯一。\n\n## 来源\n\n| 来源 | 文件 | PDF页 | 书内页 | 定位短语 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| FH-A | 2027考研数学--概率统计就这点事-强化篇--方浩.pdf | 160–171 | 155–166 | 最大似然估计 |\n| L880 | 【A4紧凑版】880数一线概篇做题本.pdf | 78 | 77 | 最大似然估计 |\n\n## 上级知识节点\n\n- 参数估计（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n\n## 知识关系（提案，未生效）\n\n- prerequisite → PR10.06：建议的学习／调用前置，不是逻辑充分条件；允许其他学习顺序。\n\n## 关联正式题\n\n暂无关联正式题。\n\n## 来源标识\n\n- 参考包运行标识：`A-math-anchor-distribution-20260909-01`\n- 包内定位：`PR10.05`（仅用于本包定位，不是本地正式 ID）\n- 来源范围：`main`；锚点类型：`knowledge`"},"source:6f806d9a98dbb6f67b6e7030":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["夹逼准则","定积分","定积分不等式","数列极限"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-721/solution_01.png","original_sha256":"d4ecc07f712cec76c641df6a09a3fba618728cb5821f97df8550ea5b08f8b08e","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":424302,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:6f806d9a98dbb6f67b6e7030","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/20858c7d4676827ac07c8bea9d9869fbd2021b5aeec53cfae99d7beaa2218fda.json","sha256":"0ad45e3e6a7e494ae1aa552ed737c97f231dc4466410442f79f50d5d520143ef"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-721/solution_01.png","sha256":"d4ecc07f712cec76c641df6a09a3fba618728cb5821f97df8550ea5b08f8b08e"}],"text":""},"source:74c7f7dddaabbfe67659d5c7":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":[],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/MN4-GS-CH01-670/question_01.png","original_sha256":"ce3b3870ab7451070324bffad671672b6c73938ddba92834bce2749dddf749d9","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":84